  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Góc giữa cạnh bên và mặt đáy của hình chóp đó là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></semantics></math>.<br>Theo tính chất của hình chóp tứ giác đều ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là hình vuông nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></semantics></math> suy ra tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> đều cạnh <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>a</mi></semantics></math> .<br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>tan</mo><mover><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>⇒</mo><mover><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>60</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/a5f6274c52b3b61b1444feca3cb6ac74557369e3b4939acf772a1a996a86471f.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
